        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8510MNG, Transitional Manning Lever with Watford Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis new leverset by Emtek is featured in their latest lookbook. this stunning transitional leverset features the Manning Lever with Watford Rosette. With its classic beauty and modern simplicity, the Manning Lever with Watford Rose is sure to add elegance to all of your doors. The Watford Rose with Manning Door Lever is available in dummy, passage function, and as a privacy lever. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from the most popular finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Transitional Manning Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Brass Manning Lever and Watford Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Manning Lever with Watford Rosette",
                "description": "This new leverset by Emtek is featured in their latest lookbook. this stunning transitional leverset features the Manning Lever with Watford Rosette. With its classic beauty and modern simplicity, the Manning Lever with Watford Rose is sure to add elegance to all of your doors. The Watford Rose with Manning Door Lever is available in dummy, passage function, and as a privacy lever. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from the most popular finish colors.",
